# File System Governance

- Read `docs-governance/FILE_SYSTEM_GOVERNANCE.md` before restructuring or adding new OS-core files.
- Organize files by system responsibility, not temporary feature convenience.
- Do not turn `App.tsx`, route adapters, schema files, or storage files into multi-deployment containers.
- If a file becomes a cross-domain dumping ground, split it before adding more features.
